body:
A headless sweep of 140 page types at 375 and 1440 px (no script errors, no error
states) found these, now fixed:
- usage asides stacked above the page header on phones: the header stays first;
- toolbar icon buttons and menus stretched on phones;
- long monospace paths widened the run page: .mono wraps when it must;
- a long tab list widened the project page instead of scrolling in its row;
- unwrapped tables on AI cost; the pipelines last-run cell stacks (prototype);
- data tables that marked their name column `lead` (quality, checks, pull request).
The first-hour project test follows the shell's tab row.
